\i A simple weather application built with React that allows users to get the current weather by city or country name or by using their current location\i0 .\par
\cf1\b  Features\cf0\b0\par
- Search for current weather by entering a city or country.\par
- Get weather updates based on the user's current geographical location.\par
- Displays temperature, weather description, and humidity.\par
- Responsive design suitable for both desktop and mobile devices.\par
\par
 \cf1\b Technologies Used\cf0\b0\par
- React: JavaScript library for building user interfaces.\par
- OpenWeatherMap API: Provides weather data.\par
- HTML/CSS: For structure and styling of the application.\par
\par
\cf1\b Usage\cf0\b0\par
Enter the name of a city or country in the input field and click "Get Weather".\par
To get weather based on your current location, click "Get Current Location Weather".\par
The weather information will be displayed below the buttons.\par
\par
\cf1\b Acknowledgments\cf0\b0\par
OpenWeatherMap for providing weather data.\par
React for the amazing library.\par
